'''Bakery Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]] who can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Baby Fake (Merciless)|First Errand]] appearing on the '''9th''', '''10th''', '''23rd''', and '''24th''' of every month. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] gains increased health and range, [[Area Attack]], [[Zombie Killer]], [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target and [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]].

