==Trivia==
*The "Gyarando tribe" (ギャランド族) in Boomerang Cat's Japanese description may be a reference to the song "[https://youtu.be/60g93BdMwMU Gyarandu]" (ギャランドゥ) by [[wikipedia:Hideki Saijo|Hideki Saijo]].
**The specific term the description uses to describe how the tribe made him feel is ''kangeki'' (感激, "deep emotion"), which could be alluding to the famous line, "Hideki, kangeki!" from the [https://youtu.be/ZY-ljiEGP4Q House Vermont Curry commercials] Saijo starred in.
*Fried Chicken Cat's appearance, name and use of chicken are reminiscent of [[wikipedia:Colonel Sanders|Colonel Sanders]], the founder and mascot of [[wikipedia:KFC|KFC]].
**The fact that a unit resembling Colonel Sanders has the Curse ability may allude to the [[wikipedia:Curse of the Colonel|Curse of the Colonel]], an urban legend about Colonel Sanders's ghost cursing the [[wikipedia:Hanshin Tigers|Hanshin Tigers]] with 38 years of misfortune due to their fans throwing a statue of him off a bridge.

